WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.900
To end the war, then, the United States is fully prepared to impose a very strong round

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:10.640
of powerful tariffs, which would stop the bloodshed, I believe, very quickly.

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:16.620
But for those tariffs to be effective, European nations, all of you are gathered here right

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:17.120
now.

